# mkcert output for the E2E stack ONLY (scripts/e2e-stack.sh's `prepare`
# command) — locally generated, never committed. Covers all three E2E
# hostnames (app./api./media.speechcoach.test), unlike docker/certs/'s
# dev-stack cert (app./api. only, media.speechcoach.test does not exist in
# dev). Populate via:
#
#   ./scripts/e2e-stack.sh prepare
*.pem
